<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, JUNE 23.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, JUNE 23.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates</p>
<p>for leading currencies on Monday were as follows.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:     June 23     June 20   Dec 31 96    NET</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  272.520     272.940     247.020   10.32 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  309.250     309.250     306.830    0.79 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  157.880     158.060     158.970   -0.69 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   46.786	46.824	47.182   -0.84 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  451.720     449.940     419.180    7.76 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  140.345     140.505     141.685   -0.95 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   16.136	16.151	16.185   -0.30 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  236.190     239.000     212.430   11.18 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.871	 1.874	 1.888   -0.90 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.567	 1.565	 1.581   -0.89 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  189.480     189.695     183.135    3.46 %</p>
<p>Note: The percentage net change is calculated as the percentage</p>
<p>difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December</p>
<p>31, 1996 rate.</p>
<p>--Angelos Kiosklis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
